# Playbooks (WF-02)

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-A3-playbooks.md`. Prompt: `docs/spec-references/WF-02-playbooks.md`. Inherits WF-00.

A Playbook is overridable defaults (style, generation, language, do/don't rules), project-scoped or user-global. Precedence: explicit action > shot need > Playbook > system default. Hard rules filter the plan; soft rules inject into composePrompt. Taste profile may suggest additions (user confirms). A Playbook cannot disable safety, billing, pause, or honest flagging. Manual model choice still wins. Do not start WF-03 from this rule.
